[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15480.389, "timestamp": "04:18:00", "text": "知ってるよ、私はいつも彼女と話したかったんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15484.71, "timestamp": "04:18:04", "text": "まるで私が恥ずかしがり屋すぎるみたいだった。私は「うーん」って感じでした"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15485.261, "timestamp": "04:18:05", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hm hm"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15487.99, "timestamp": "04:18:07", "text": "話したいんだけど、どうすればいいの？何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15492.63, "timestamp": "04:18:12", "text": "私はそもそも話すの？そして私は本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15495.269, "timestamp": "04:18:15", "text": "本当に恥ずかしい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15498.07, "timestamp": "04:18:18", "text": "などなど。私はとても嬉しかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15503.349, "timestamp": "04:18:23", "text": "2021年頃、その日に彼女を発見した。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15505.11, "timestamp": "04:18:25", "text": "うん。彼女はTwitchで配信していた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15508.149, "timestamp": "04:18:28", "text": "ゲームをプレイしてとてもエネルギッシュ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15511.51, "timestamp": "04:18:31", "text": "そして陽気だった。ええ、そうです。そして私は見た"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15513.91, "timestamp": "04:18:33", "text": "Twitchで彼女を発見した時、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15516.95, "timestamp": "04:18:36", "text": "インドタグ、インド、VTuberのように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15520.63, "timestamp": "04:18:40", "text": "彼女のTwitchチャンネルにタグ付けしてください。そして私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15523.11, "timestamp": "04:18:43", "text": "「ああ、なんてことだ、インドのユーチューバーが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15526.149, "timestamp": "04:18:46", "text": "トゥイッチ。 「私はもう一人じゃない。」そして"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15530.357, "timestamp": "04:18:50", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "noice"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15532.149, "timestamp": "04:18:52", "text": "会えてとても嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15533.671, "timestamp": "04:18:53", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/HvgfY93GEYmqvwLUuYDwAQUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/HvgfY93GEYmqvwLUuYDwAQUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/HvgfY93GEYmqvwLUuYDwAQ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15533.99, "timestamp": "04:18:53", "text": "誰か。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15535.99, "timestamp": "04:18:55", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15539.51, "timestamp": "04:18:59", "text": "そして彼女は私と同じ言語を知っている"}]